    "sections": {
        "description": "Pool Maintenance is a clean and structured website theme designed for pool-related service websites. The layout includes sections for service listings, maintenance schedules, pricing tables, contact information, and customer inquiries. It supports responsive design, allowing content to adapt across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. The theme includes customizable homepage sections, banner areas, image galleries, testimonial blocks, and service highlights. Navigation is arranged to help visitors access important information quickly. Integrated blog layouts allow regular publishing of maintenance tips, cleaning guides, and updates. Additional features include social media integration, call-to-action buttons, multiple page templates, and support for contact forms. The theme is compatible with common plugins for SEO, caching, and performance optimization. Typography and color settings can be adjusted through the customization panel without editing code. Its overall structure focuses on clear content presentation and organized service information while maintaining a simple and professional appearance suitable for maintenance-related websites."
    },
